# sdd/templates/bdd-scenarios.md.template
# 用于在 capability/requirements.md 内嵌的 BDD examples 段；高风险 REQ 必填.
# Phase M0 skeleton template — 每 REQ ≥ 1 个 acceptance example.

## REQ-NNN <REQ statement>

**Priority**: critical / high / medium / low

**BDD Examples**:

> 用 Given-When-Then 描述 acceptance criteria；每个 example 应可直接 → behavior.feature scenario.

- **Example 1（happy path）**：
  - Given <baseline precondition>
  - When <user / agent action>
  - Then <observable outcome>

- **Example 2（alternative path / boundary）**：
  - Given <alternative context>
  - When <variation>
  - Then <expected behavior>

- **Example 3（negative case / HITL trigger）**：
  - Given <conditions triggering rejection>
  - When <user / agent action>
  - Then <rejection / HITL behavior>

---

> 引用：每 example 映射到 `contracts/behavior.feature` 一个 scenario；scenario name 与 example
> 描述一致（避免双重维护）.
> @hitl 标签：若 example 描述 HITL 触发，behavior.feature scenario 必加 @hitl 标签.
